          "kind": "reaction",
          "description": "Trigger A creature damages the imugi's chosen koi egg or ends its turn within 40 feet of the egg\nEffect The imugi Strides or Swims toward the triggering creature. If they end their movement within reach of the creature, they can attempt a melee Strike against it.",
          "traits": []
