          "id": "MYBjuJKpzNnE178Z",
          "name": "Eye Pluck",
          "kind": "action",
          "description": "Frequency once per round\nRequirements The lamp blighter's last action was a successful claw Strike against a creature with eyes\nEffect The lamp blighter attempts to pluck out one of the required creature's eyes. The target must attempt a check (fortitude, dc:21) save. On a failure, the target takes 4 persistent bleed damage and is Dazzled for 1 round. On a critical failure, the target's eye is also severely damaged, taking a –4 circumstance penalty on all sight-based Perception checks until the target returns to full Hit Points or the wound is otherwise healed (by magic such as Sound Body or Regenerate). If all a creature's eyes are severely damaged in this way, that creature is Blinded for the same duration.\nEffect: Eye Pluck",
