          "kind": "reaction",
          "description": "Trigger A creature within reach of the vorvorak's tail uses a move action or leaves a square during a move action it's using\nEffect The vorvorak attempts a tail Strike against the triggering creature. If the attack is a critical hit, the vorvorak disrupts the action.",
          "traits": []
