          "description": "Trigger The dragon is critically hit with a melee weapon or unarmed attack\nEffect The dragon's blood forms into hard spheres as it erupts from the wound, battering the attacker. The creature who dealt the triggering damage takes 5d6 bludgeoning damage with a check (reflex, dc:26, basic) save.",
