          "name": "Galvanic Barrage",
          "kind": "action",
          "description": "The dragon exhales a massive bolt of lightning at one creature within 100 feet, dealing 5d12 electricity damage with a check (reflex, dc:28, basic) save. The lightning then arcs to a creature of the dragon's choice within 30 feet of the previous target with the same effect. The dragon can't target the same creature more than once, and they must have line of effect to all targets. The bolt can continue to arc this way until the dragon runs out of targets or until a target critically succeeds at their save. The dragon can't use Galvanic Barrage again for 1d4.",
