          "name": "Flummoxing Flurry",
          "kind": "reaction",
          "description": "Trigger The swarm takes damage\nEffect The swarm's frenzied flapping intensifies as the dragonets attempt to confuse their foes. Each creature in the swarm's space must succeed at a check (will, dc:28, options:area-effect,inflicts:dazzled) save or become Dazzled until they are outside of the swarm's space.",
