          "name": "Word of Advice",
          "kind": "action",
          "description": "Frequency once per round\nEffect The dragon is a skilled mentor, and commands its students like a general. An ally within 60 feet of the dragon can Stride once and Strike once, in any order. If it hits, the Strike deals an additional 2d6 fire damage.\nEffect: Word of Advice",
