          "name": "Tenebrous Breath",
          "kind": "action",
          "description": "The dragon breathes a blast of darkness that deals 12d6 void damage in a 30-foot type:cone (check (reflex, dc:30, basic) save). Undead creatures take 12d6 force damage instead of void damage. The dragon can't use Tenebrous Breath again for 1d4.",
