          "kind": "action",
          "description": "The dragon strikes a pose that makes its hide sparkle in the light. Each creature within 20-foot emanation must succeed at a check (fortitude, dc:27, options:area-effect,inflicts:dazzled) save or become Dazzled for 1 round.",
