          "description": "1 to 3\nThe dragon emits pulses of energy that radiates outward in a 15-foot type:emanation, dealing 2d6+2 force damage (check (reflex, dc:32, basic, options:area-effect) save).\nFor each action spent, a new pulse of energy is created and each subsequent pulse after the first is 5 feet larger than the previous one.",
