          "kind": "passive",
          "description": "When a sea dragon is damaged by a spell or unarmed Strike of a creature with the metal trait, or a metallic weapon, the dragon's scales transform and grant them a +1 item bonus to AC until the start of their next turn.\nEffect: Fed by Metal",
