          "name": "Black Water Breath",
          "kind": "action",
          "description": "The dragon shoots a ball of water that deals 13d6 bludgeoning damage in a 25-foot burst within 50 feet (check (reflex, dc:32, basic, options:area-effect) save). All non-magical fire in the radius is extinguished. The dragon can't use Black Water Breath again for 1d4.",
