          "name": "Rise Up",
          "kind": "reaction",
          "description": "Trigger A creature walks on top of an ancient bog dragon who is burrowed into the mud or peat below\nRequirements Initiative has not yet been rolled\nEffect The bog dragon automatically notices the creature and Burrows before rolling initiative.",
          "traits": []
