          "name": "Wing Deflection",
          "kind": "reaction",
          "description": "Trigger The dragon is targeted with an attack\nEffect The dragon raises a wing, gaining a +2 circumstance bonus to AC against the triggering attack. If the dragon is Flying, they descend 10 feet after the attack.",
          "traits": []
