          "name": "Divine Sanctification",
          "kind": "passive",
          "description": "Once an executor dragon reaches adulthood, they are expected to sanctify as either holy or unholy; they gain the corresponding trait and weakness 15 to the opposing sanctification.",
          "traits": []
