          "description": "Trigger The dragon is critically hit by an attack\nEffect Raw divine power flashes through the executor dragon harming anyone who dares strike it so brazenly. The creature who dealt the triggering attack takes 7d8 spirit damage with a check (will, dc:37, basic) save.",
