          "description": "The dragon spits a molten boulder at a target within 120 feet. This deals 12d6 fire damage] damage, with a check (reflex, dc:40, basic) save. If the creature fails its save, it's encased in magma that instantly cools and has Hardness 10, HP 40, and BT 20. The encased creature can't breathe and is Restrained (Escape DC 40).",
