          "name": "Mentalist Counterspell",
          "kind": "reaction",
          "description": "Trigger The dragon is targeted by a mental effect they're aware of\nEffect The dragon immediately attempts to counteract the triggering effect (counteract modifier 1d20+32, counteract rank 10).",
