          "id": "3kUwThRcY12CF1EP",
          "name": "Cataclysm",
          "kind": "action",
          "description": "Frequency once per day\nEffect The magma archdragon releases its primal fury in full. Magma rips from the ground in a 30-foot type:burst within 240 feet. Each creature in the area takes 14d6 fire damage damage, with a check (reflex, dc:44, basic, options:area-effect) save.",
