          "id": "2y5PjoJxmfA6wGl8",
          "name": "Miasma",
          "kind": "passive",
          "description": "20 feet.\nAfter the dragon uses their Poison Breath, a cloud of poison gas continues to emanate from their body for 1 round. Any creature that ends its turn in the miasma takes 6d6 poison damage (check (fortitude, dc:43, basic, options:area-effect) save).\nAny creature in the miasma is Concealed and treats other creatures as concealed. The dragon can see through this concealment.",
