          "name": "Opportunistic Halt",
          "kind": "reaction",
          "description": "Trigger A creature within 5 feet uses a move action or leaves a square during a move action it's using\nEffect The novitiates strike at the triggering creature, dealing 2d8+3 bludgeoning damage (check (reflex, dc:19, basic) save). If the save is a critical failure and the trigger was a move action, that action is disrupted.",
