          "kind": "action",
          "description": "he battalion draws and hurls alchemical bombs with practiced precision. The bombs rain down in a 10-foot type:burst within 30 feet that deals 3d8 fire damage damage (check (reflex, dc:22, basic) save). When the troop is reduced to 2 segments, this area decreases to a 5-foot type:burst. Creatures adjacent to the burst take 1d4 splash fire damage.",
