          "description": "1 to 3\nFrequency once per round\nEffect The champions slash mercilessly with their broadswords against enemies in a 5-foot type:emanation (check (reflex, dc:27, basic) save). The damage depends on the number of actions.\n1 1d8+3 slashing damage\n2 2d8+12 slashing damage\n3 3d8+14 slashing damage",
