          "description": "The champions draw or reload their longbows, then launch a ranged attack in the form of a volley. This volley is a 10-foot type:burst within 100 feet that deals 5d8 piercing damage (check (reflex, dc:27, basic) save). When the troop is reduced to 2 segments, this area decreases to a 5-foot type:burst.",
