          "kind": "action",
          "description": "Frequency once per round\nEffect The honor guard strikes with their maces against enemies in a 5-foot type:emanation, battering souls as well as bodies (check (reflex, dc:29, basic) save). The damage depends on the number of actions.\n1 1d6+1 bludgeoning damage\n2 2d6+9 bludgeoning damage\n3 3d6+12 bludgeoning damage",
